{"obsah":"<p>This weekend was a bit quieter, and part of our team was jumping for the kids and adults who came to the village festival in Hrušovany nad Jevišovkou. The picturesque village with a modern new sports hall and outdoor sports ground provided a great atmosphere. We were a bit taken aback by the incredible heat – it was almost 8 degrees warmer than in Prague and the surrounding area.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>We threw ourselves into training and, unfortunately, also into fixing some minor technical problems with the bikes.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>I think the locals understand sport, because the whole time we were there, apart from riding, we did nothing but sign cards and take photos with the local youngsters :) </p>\n\n<p>Thanks for the invitation – the touring party: Vlasta, Lukáš Valný and Matouš Balík</p>\n\n<p>On Sunday part of the team went looking for new trails in the Šembera valley. Sometimes you just need to switch off and take a moment for yourself on a full-suspension bike. Afterwards Vlasta and his family went to check out the promotion of the Říčanské Šlapačky Bikefestival. Thanks to Pavel Hájek's work, there was hardly a bike-related place without a poster or banner :)</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2F7f908f71-b0c2-43a5-a3a9-02c29cea2b51.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2F7f908f71-b0c2-43a5-a3a9-02c29cea2b51.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209348\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2F112ed17d-7850-4765-a946-3af01e009649.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2F112ed17d-7850-4765-a946-3af01e009649.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209347\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5602-2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5602-2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209346\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5663.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5663.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209345\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FHrusovany-nad-Jevisovkou1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FHrusovany-nad-Jevisovkou1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209344\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FHrusovany-nad-Jevisovkou2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FHrusovany-nad-Jevisovkou2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209343\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-as